  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Hourglass v0.6A\nmade by Dude of Dudovia\n\nmade using Unity\nChangelog
    V0.6B\n\tFixed a Bug Where the Changelog Was not Contained in It's Scrollbox.\n\tFixed
    a Bug Where the Number That Displayed Font Size Was Rendering On a Layer It Wasn't
    Supposed to.\n\tFixed a Bug Where the App Would Be Launched In Fullscreen On
    Windows.\nChangelog V0.6A\n\tChanged Commit Time to Log Time\n\t\tThis Was to
    Be Clearer.\n\tAdded The Ability to Press Enter to Log Time.\n\tUpdated The UI\n\t\tAdded
    Several Animations.\n\tAdded Used Time Display\n\t\tAdded a Small Button to Swap
    its Function with Remaining Time DIsplay.\n\tAdded Options\n\t\tAdded Options
    for Displaying Milliseconds.\n\t\tAdded the Ability to Change The Background
    Color.\n\t\tAdded Options for Changing Animation Times.\n\t\tAdded Options for
    Changing Colors of Logged Times.\n\t\tMoved the Reset App Button Here.\n\t\tMoved
    the Toggle for \"Advanced Formatting\" Here.\n\tChanged the Frame Rate to Match
    Refresh Rate.\n\tFixed a Bug Where Time Entries Could Be Deleted While the Menu
    Was Open.\n\tFixed Capitalization On Old Changelogs.\n\tAdded an Exit App Button.\n\tReduced
    General Bugginess.\nChangelog V0.5B\n\tMade persistance of Advanced Formatting
    More Consistant.\nChangelog V0.5A\n\tDragging Boxes of the Added Times Now Un-Adds
    the Time.\n\tDragging Profiles Now Deletes Them.\n\tUpdated Textures and Made
    Other Slight UI Changes\n\tFixed Bugs Regarding Profiles\nChangelog V0.4C\n\tFIxed
    Bug Timer Would Be Set to a Value Insanely High if Reset and the Application
    was Relaunched\nChangelog V0.4B\n\tImproved the Persistence of the Rich Format
    Toggle.\nChangelog V0.4A\n\tImproved Time Adding System\n\t\tSupport Adding Based
    on Hours and Seconds Etc:\n\t\t\t1:30:2 Would be 1 Hour 30 Minutes and 2 Seconds.\n\tAdded
    Profiles\n\tUpdated UI\n\t\tChanged Logos\nChangelog v0.3B\n\tUpdated UI\n\t\tIt
    Now Scales Numbers\n\tFixed bugs\n\t\tIt Now Saves the Default Time\nChangelog
    v0.3A\n\tChanged the UI\n\tAdded Update with New Total Button\n\tDid Minor Bug
    Fixing\n\tAdded This Menu\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9211fcdd38f50ef4c8fd7ddcb1c03d12, type: 2}
